# OS
.DS_Store

# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/.terragrunt-cache/
**/.terragrunt-stack/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Terraform variable files may hold secret values; ignore by default.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example

# Helm
**/charts/*.tgz

# Secrets: only the personal lab's own per-value encrypted ciphertext files
# (one file per value, never combined - constitution §5/§14), one-way bcrypt
# hashes, and plain non-secret values like the Kafka cluster ID (all safe to
# commit as plain text, see secrets/README.md), under secrets/vk-lab-platform/,
# plus this directory's own docs, are tracked. Every other secrets/<project>/
# directory - throwaway CI/test projects, make generate-secrets output - is
# fully untracked, *.enc included; it's meant to be regenerated, not committed.
secrets/*
!secrets/vk-lab-platform/
secrets/vk-lab-platform/*
!secrets/vk-lab-platform/*.enc
!secrets/vk-lab-platform/*.bcrypt
!secrets/vk-lab-platform/kafka-cluster-id.txt
!secrets/README.md

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Claude Code local state: permissions, worktrees, session data - all machine-specific
.claude/
